From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ysfaculty <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:07:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 155/160] hjviewer: review fixes for the account deletion
 (1.9.1)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The deletion logs this PC out as a logout does, so its confirmation now
carries L1's warning where the logout dialog has it: on a desktop whose
registration goes with the login (a PC this login bound, an app that is
not installed), while someone uses it from afar and the server is or may
be staff-only. The password-less connection of that session ends with
the deletion, and no connection comes back in once the others end.

The login records that stay name the ID as the other screens do:
"연세포탈 ID" ("Yonsei portal ID").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart       | 9 +++++++++
 flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account_texts.dart | 8 ++++++--
 flutter/test/hjviewer_account_test.dart        | 7 +++++++
 3 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart b/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart
index d625537..542e06b 100644
--- a/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart
+++ b/flutter/lib/common/hjviewer_account.dart
@@ -1421,6 +1421,9 @@ Widget _deleteAccountButton(BuildContext context, HjvTexts t) {
 void _askDeleteAccount() {
   final t = _t;
   final gate = hjvDeleteAccountGateNote(t, gateCloses: hjvAccessGateCloses());
+  // this PC is logged out as by a logout: L1's warning while someone uses it from afar
+  final boundHere = _commonSync('hjv-pc-bound') == 'Y';
+  final remoteNow = hjvAccessLogoutNote(boundHere: boundHere)?.warning != null;
   final word = TextEditingController();
   var busy = false;
   var closed = false;
@@ -1468,6 +1471,12 @@ void _askDeleteAccount() {
             ]).marginOnly(top: 4),
           Text(hjvKeepAll(t.deleteAccountFresh)).marginOnly(top: 8),
           if (gate != null) Text(hjvKeepAll(gate)).marginOnly(top: 8),
+          if (remoteNow)
+            hjvNoteBlock(context,
+                    icon: Icons.warning_amber_rounded,
+                    text: Text(hjvKeepAll(t.deleteAccountRemoteNow)),
+                    warning: true)
+                .marginOnly(top: 8),
           ExcludeSemantics(child: Text(hjvKeepAll(t.deleteAccountType)))
               .marginOnly(top: 12),
           Semantics(
